  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-one-little-bite-v8-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "b6fa75baf15041954717592680f58c07450aa09321cca02b9171de3bc8ccf32a",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "344254aab50f8f65219305ae8c5b5734e2bb410e6f847ac110372ef12be85322",
      "text": "悟空\n尝一小口",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5bc9212d32023d2e194bd5ffb1035b4b0f26dfea8ad570a01c76f8935c010fec",
      "text": "太阳慢慢落山了。\n悟空抱着他的桃子。\n“我只吃桃子！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9cc17a47b19774028e5f945223e61ea1a26fb2c86b0534cc8820c019001713b6",
      "text": "“来帮忙做晚饭吧。”\n八戒说。\n悟空帮忙洗胡萝卜。\n哗啦！鼻子也湿了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ef85cd4e1f533c2bee6f47cae2c0832134089c3a59fc8a7e1df118b526bd7618",
      "text": "沙僧搅着锅里的菜。\n一片叶子落在\n悟空的桃子上。\n“我的桃子戴帽子啦！”\n他咯咯地笑。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3f17e4068fba6498ccb48aa669c0116f50d1fac17745c972b158edcf32392dcd",
      "text": "一股香味飘过来。\n“那是什么呀？”悟空问。\n“热乎乎的胡萝卜呀。”\n沙僧说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7308d1879a376b98f3b1b8259323ebacaa5399ee8dc2035376f61d7c2911d2a3",
      "text": "悟空尝了一小口。\n“哦！又甜又软。”\n他把桃子\n放在碗旁边。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "eb1ae5589120d4464f72804d2b4fedfe4935c38bd75e9d6aa8b25871c337c678",
      "text": "“再尝片青菜？”\n悟空咬了一小口。\n“嗯，软软的，还有汁呢！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ef8b8f077fddb8a606ab2a20febe042587ab848449fa5f4bb8c61708302bc2ac",
      "text": "他尝了米饭，\n还有小块小块的豆腐。\n这个尝一点，\n那个尝一点。\n“我的碗里有新朋友啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "555c39114ba3f092f1f3f6c4a830f20376be164f652a2cc1be54ac46a8cce2ea",
      "text": "月光洒在餐桌上。\n悟空吃完最后一口桃子。\n“桃子好吃，这些也好吃！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bb3cbe7049db87737de19a84616f6020dce2fe41f4af4e214bc1fcc44dee8651",
      "text": "悟空钻进被窝。\n“晚安，小饭碗。\n晚安，朋友们。”\n明天，他还可以\n尝尝新东西。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果你和孩子喜欢这些故事，\n欢迎支持我继续创作。支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n这些故事和插画由作者借助 AI 创作，并经过人工编辑。\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · 署名—非商业性使用—禁止演绎\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
